[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C18_SENDAKS_PLAN]
Sendak’s Plan

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_4EP_C18_SENDAKS_PLAN_DESC]
What exactly does Sendak want to do? Although he wants to take revenge on Tirek, it is by no means just revenge — he will seize the throne of the centaur kingdom. Then, will they wage war on us?

